### Tags.

## The menu entries of a tag.

tags-new-here = New tag here…
tags-new-annotated-here = New annotated tag here…
tags-annotate = Annotate tag…
# On the heading of the tags.
tags-push-all = Push every tag…
tags-details = Tag details…
tags-push = Push tag
tags-delete = Delete tag…
tags-delete-remote = Delete tag on the remote…

## A tag's details, a line each.

# $kind is the kind of object the tag points at (commit, tree…); $target its short id.
tags-details-annotated = An annotated tag on the { $kind } { $target }
tags-details-lightweight = A lightweight tag on the { $kind } { $target }: a name and nothing more
# $time is a date and a time.
tags-details-tagged-by = Tagged by { $name } <{ $email }> on { $time }
tags-details-not-signed = Not signed
